# Walkthrough — Phase 3: Document Ingestion & Evidence Intake

## Executive Summary

Phase 3 implements the production-grade **Document Ingestion & Evidence Intake** pipeline for the **Indian Equity Research Intelligence Terminal**. The pipeline ingests multi-format research materials (Annual Reports, Concall Transcripts, Investor Presentations, Financial Statements, Screener/TradingView screenshots), preserves strict page boundaries, applies deterministic document classification and reporting period extraction, enforces SHA-256 duplicate detection, provides OCR status and confidence gating with optional confidence metrics, and audits two-year annual report baseline readiness.

