### A. Document Types & Identity Model
- **File**: [`DocumentTypes.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/ingestion/DocumentTypes.ts)
- `DocumentType`: `ANNUAL_REPORT`, `FINANCIAL_STATEMENTS`, `MDA`, `CONCALL_TRANSCRIPT`, `INVESTOR_PRESENTATION`, `SHAREHOLDING_PATTERN`, `SCREENER_SCREENSHOT`, `TECHNICAL_CHART`, `OTHER`, `UNKNOWN`.
- `PageOcrStatus`: `NOT_REQUIRED`, `PENDING`, `PROCESSING`, `COMPLETE`, `FAILED`, `REQUIRES_REVIEW`.
- `ocrConfidence?: number`: Undefined for machine-readable pages (never represented as 0%).

### B. Deterministic Classification & Period Detection
- **Files**: [`DocumentClassifier.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/ingestion/DocumentClassifier.ts), [`PeriodDetector.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/ingestion/PeriodDetector.ts)
- Deterministic regex keyword classification and period extraction (FY24, FY2024, Q3FY24, 2023-24). Reverts safely to `UNKNOWN` when ambiguous.

### C. SHA-256 Hasher & Duplicate Detection
- **File**: [`DocumentHasher.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/ingestion/DocumentHasher.ts)
- Prevents accidental duplicate uploads by computing SHA-256 hashes across project materials.

### D. OCR Processor & Page Confidence Gating
- **File**: [`OcrProcessor.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/ingestion/OcrProcessor.ts)
- Enforces strict OCR thresholds (>90% High, 80-90% Medium, <80% Low -> `REQUIRES_REVIEW`). Machine text pages receive `ocrStatus: NOT_REQUIRED` and `ocrConfidence: undefined`.

### E. Two-Year Annual Report Audit Engine
- **File**: [`TwoYearReportAudit.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/ingestion/TwoYearReportAudit.ts)
- Verifies that two distinct consecutive fiscal years exist (FY-1 & FY-0) and warns on duplicate same-year filings.

